					"uidString" : "W0dMEXvrR7WP0VBB4hEZZw=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "An LLM data view gives an object a representation that LLMs can consume. The **LLM views** tab in the object inspector lists the data views the object exposes. Tools such as the Smalltalk evaluation tool include the returned object’s JSON views under `objectDetails`."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T08:06:52.952788+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T10:17:15.426988+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "WlhdzeBPStq9SrVx7cPjnQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "An LLM data view is defined in a one-argument method on the object that owns the data. The {{gtPragma:gtLlmDataView}} pragma marks the method. The view’s title labels it in the inspector, and `dataKey:` names its field in the JSON result. A block supplies the data on demand. {{gtMethod:GtLDataView>>#jsonObject:}} takes a block that returns a JSON-ready object. {{gtMethod:GtLDataView>>#magritteObject:}} serializes the object returned by the block using its Magritte descriptions."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T08:06:52.955579+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T10:17:17.939946+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "yLvkYqs1R66cHdFMJd8AUQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "{{gtSymbol:forwardObject}} with `object: [ ... ]` delegates to another object. By default, the forwarding view collects all of the target’s data views and exposes their keys at the current level. The optional `view:` selects one view, and `dataKey:` nests the forwarded data under a key. {{gtMethod:GtSearchFilter>>#llmResultDataViewsFor:}} forwards the views of its result stream this way."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T08:06:52.960027+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T10:17:20.881907+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "OUcrAQo6RQGcNuJ2rk8OrQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "{{gtMethod:GtAsyncSearchMethodGroupStream>>#llmMatchingMethodsDataViewFor:}} contributes the `methodMatches` field. It reads a copy of the stream, collects at most 50 method references, and checks one extra match to set `mayHaveMore`. The Smalltalk snippet below returns the filter’s JSON data."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "pharoSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
					"items" : [ ]
				},
				"createEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T08:06:52.963857+01:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail" : {
					"__type" : "email",
					"emailString" : "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime" : {
					"__type" : "time",
					"time" : {
						"__type" : "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString" : "2026-11-27T08:06:52.963857+01:00"
					}
				},
				"uid" : {
					"__type" : "uid",
					"uidString" : "LzgM8c7FTyi2zh2Xh/oJcw=="
				},
				"code" : "| filter |\nfilter := 'GToolkit-Pharo-Coder-AddOns' asPackage gtMethodsInPackage\n\t& (Color gtReferences | BrGlamorousColors gtReferences).\n((filter llmDataViewsFor: GtLDataView new) serializeToLlmPrimiteData) llmJsonData"
			},
			{
